Bind Npc 31518 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 31522 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 558 "[Hidden Truth] Find the Vestige"
    Journal for karus "You must find [Valley Surveillance Scout] of Eslant."
    Journal for elmorad "You must find [Valley Surveillance Scout] of Eslant."

Requires player level >= 64 and quest 557 is completed

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "It's a place where you [Eyeless Hero] by the southwest. So Go ahead."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "It's a place where you [Eyeless Hero] by the southwest. So Go ahead"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "<selfname> Do not?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "This is an honor. No way lines come by <selfname>, did not know\n\nAh, this is not the time for such matters. We are currently monitoring the situation for entering the valley, and so far, there have been no issues.\n\nYou have just heard about hero's favor from Beda. Go find[Valley Surveillance Scout] and talk to him."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "<selfname> Do not?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "This is an honor. No way lines come by <selfname>, did not know.\n\nYou have just heard about hero's favor from Tabeth. Go find[Valley Surveillance Scout] and talk to him."

On claimable
    Show quest "So from now on, thank you. Bag entry'm requested to formal support by <selfname> for the bar."
